==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Probably of Creole origin, cognate with [[Gullah]] {{term|moco||lang=gul|witchcraft}}, [[Fula]] {{term|moco'o||lang=ff|medicine man}}

Mojo is a made up word.  It comes from the song L.A. Woman by the Doors.  The song contains the lyric "Mr Mojo Risin".  Mr Mojo Risin is an acronym for Jim Morrison, the lead singer of the doors.

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|əʊdʒəʊ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A magic [[charm]] or spell.
# Supernatural power or luck.

